    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Tarea 05\"\nsubtitle: \"Fecha de entrega: 20 de marzo de 2026\"\n---\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.callout-note icon=false}\n## Criterio de la segunda derivada\nPara encontrar los puntos máximos y mínimos relativos de una función, utilizamos el siguiente procedimiento:\n\n1. **Obtener la primera derivada** $f'(x)$.\n2. **Encontrar los puntos críticos** igualando la primera derivada a cero ($f'(x) = 0$) y resolviendo para $x$.\n3. **Obtener la segunda derivada** $f''(x)$.\n4. **Evaluar los puntos críticos en la segunda derivada** para determinar su naturaleza:\n   * Si $f''(x) > 0$, la función es cóncava hacia arriba y tenemos un **mínimo**.\n   * Si $f''(x) < 0$, la función es cóncava hacia abajo y tenemos un **máximo**.\n5. **Calcular la coordenada $y$** evaluando el punto crítico en la función original.\n\n:::\n---\n\n::: panel-tabset\n\n### $f(x) = x^3 - 3x^2 + 2x - 3$\n\n**1. Primera derivada**\n\n$$f'(x) = 3x^2 - 6x+2$$\n\n**2. Puntos críticos ($f'(x) = 0$)**\n\nFactorizamos $f'(x)$, como no es fácilmente factorizable, utilizamos la fórmula general ($x = \\frac{-b \\pm \\sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a}$):\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nx &= \\frac{-(-6) \\pm \\sqrt{(-6)^2 - 4(3)(2)}}{2(3)} \\\\\nx &= \\frac{6 \\pm \\sqrt{36 - 24}}{6} \\\\\nx &= \\frac{6 \\pm \\sqrt{12}}{6}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nSimplificando el radical ($\\sqrt{12} = \\sqrt{4 \\cdot 3} = 2\\sqrt{3}$) tenemos que:\n\n$$\nx = \\frac{6 \\pm 2\\sqrt{3}}{6} = 1 \\pm \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\n$$\nNuestros puntos críticos son:\n\n* $x_1 = 1 - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$\n* $x_2 = 1 + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$\n\n**3. Segunda derivada**\n$$f''(x) = 6x - 6$$\n\n**4. Evaluamos puntos críticos**\n\n* Para $x_1= 1 - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$: \n\n$$\nf''(1 - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}) = 6(1 - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}) - 6\\\\\nf''(1 - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}) = 6- \\frac{6\\sqrt{3}}{3} - 6\\\\\nf''(1 - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}) = - 2\\sqrt{3}\n$$ \n\nPor el signo negativo podemos inferor que es un valor menor a cero, por lo tanto hay un **máximo**.\n\n* Para $x_2= 1 + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$: \n\n$$\nf''(1 + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}) = 6(1 + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}) - 6 \\\\\nf''(1 + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}) = 6 + \\frac{6\\sqrt{3}}{3} - 6 \\\\\nf''(1 + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}) = 2\\sqrt{3}\n$$\n\nEste valor es mayor a cero, por lo tanto tenemos un **mínimo**.\n\n\n**5. Coordenadas finales**\n\nEvaluamos los puntos críticos en la función original $f(x)$:\n* $x_1 = 1 - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$\n* $x_2 = 1 + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$\n\n* $f(1 - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}) = (0.42)^3 - 3(0.42)^2 + 2(0.42) - 3 \\approx -2.62 \\implies \\text{Punto Máximo: } \\mathbf{(0.42, -2.62)}$\n* $f(1.58) = (1.58)^3 - 3(1.58)^2 + 2(1.58) - 3 \\approx -3.38 \\implies \\text{Punto Mínimo: } \\mathbf{(1.58, -3.38)}$\n\nEvaluamos los puntos críticos exactos en la función original $f(x) = x^3 - 3x^2 + 2x - 3$. \n*(Nota algebraica: Al desarrollar los binomios al cubo y al cuadrado, muchos términos con raíces se cancelan o simplifican)*.\n\n* Evaluando el máximo ($x = 1 - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$):\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf\\left(1 - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\right) &= \\left(1 - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\right)^3 - 3\\left(1 - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\right)^2 + 2\\left(1 - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\right) - 3 \\\\\n&= -3 + \\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{9}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nPor lo tanto, el **punto máximo**:  $\\mathbf{\\left(1 - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}, -3 + \\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{9}\\right)}$\n\n* Evaluando el mínimo ($x = 1 + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$):\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf\\left(1 + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\right) &= \\left(1 + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\right)^3 - 3\\left(1 + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\right)^2 + 2\\left(1 + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\right) - 3 \\\\\n&= -3 - \\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{9}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nPor lo tanto, el **punto mínimo**: $\\mathbf{\\left(1 + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}, -3 - \\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{9}\\right)}$\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"highchart html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-289af14a11ae6fed7c35\" style=\"width:100%;height:464px;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-289af14a11ae6fed7c35\">{\"x\":{\"hc_opts\":{\"chart\":{\"reflow\":true},\"title\":{\"text\":null},\"yAxis\":{\"title\":{\"text\":\"f(x)\"},\"type\":\"linear\"},\"credits\":{\"enabled\":false},\"exporting\":{\"enabled\":false},\"boost\":{\"enabled\":false},\"plotOptions\":{\"series\":{\"label\":{\"enabled\":false},\"turboThreshold\":0,\"showInLegend\":false},\"treemap\":{\"layoutAlgorithm\":\"squarified\"},\"scatter\":{\"marker\":{\"symbol\":\"circle\"},\"dataLabels\":{\"enabled\":true,\"format\":\"{point.label}\",\"y\":-15,\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"11px\"}}}},\"series\":[{\"group\":\"group\",\"data\":[{\"x\":-0.5,\"y\":-4.875},{\"x\":-0.45,\"y\":-4.599},{\"x\":-0.4,\"y\":-4.344},{\"x\":-0.35,\"y\":-4.11},{\"x\":-0.3,\"y\":-3.897},{\"x\":-0.25,\"y\":-3.703},{\"x\":-0.2,\"y\":-3.528},{\"x\":-0.15,\"y\":-3.371},{\"x\":-0.1,\"y\":-3.231},{\"x\":-0.05,\"y\":-3.108},{\"x\":0,\"y\":-3},{\"x\":0.05,\"y\":-2.907},{\"x\":0.1,\"y\":-2.829},{\"x\":0.15,\"y\":-2.764},{\"x\":0.2,\"y\":-2.712},{\"x\":0.25,\"y\":-2.672},{\"x\":0.3,\"y\":-2.643},{\"x\":0.35,\"y\":-2.625},{\"x\":0.4,\"y\":-2.616},{\"x\":0.45,\"y\":-2.616},{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":-2.625},{\"x\":0.55,\"y\":-2.641},{\"x\":0.6,\"y\":-2.664},{\"x\":0.65,\"y\":-2.693},{\"x\":0.7,\"y\":-2.727},{\"x\":0.75,\"y\":-2.766},{\"x\":0.8,\"y\":-2.808},{\"x\":0.85,\"y\":-2.853},{\"x\":0.9,\"y\":-2.901},{\"x\":0.95,\"y\":-2.95},{\"x\":1,\"y\":-3},{\"x\":1.05,\"y\":-3.05},{\"x\":1.1,\"y\":-3.099},{\"x\":1.15,\"y\":-3.147},{\"x\":1.2,\"y\":-3.192},{\"x\":1.25,\"y\":-3.234},{\"x\":1.3,\"y\":-3.273},{\"x\":1.35,\"y\":-3.307},{\"x\":1.4,\"y\":-3.336},{\"x\":1.45,\"y\":-3.359},{\"x\":1.5,\"y\":-3.375},{\"x\":1.55,\"y\":-3.384},{\"x\":1.6,\"y\":-3.384},{\"x\":1.65,\"y\":-3.375},{\"x\":1.7,\"y\":-3.357},{\"x\":1.75,\"y\":-3.328},{\"x\":1.8,\"y\":-3.288},{\"x\":1.85,\"y\":-3.236},{\"x\":1.9,\"y\":-3.171},{\"x\":1.95,\"y\":-3.093},{\"x\":2,\"y\":-3},{\"x\":2.05,\"y\":-2.892},{\"x\":2.1,\"y\":-2.769},{\"x\":2.15,\"y\":-2.629},{\"x\":2.2,\"y\":-2.472},{\"x\":2.25,\"y\":-2.297},{\"x\":2.3,\"y\":-2.103},{\"x\":2.35,\"y\":-1.89},{\"x\":2.4,\"y\":-1.656},{\"x\":2.45,\"y\":-1.401},{\"x\":2.5,\"y\":-1.125}],\"type\":\"line\",\"color\":\"#2980B9\",\"name\":\"f(x) = x³ - 3x² + 2x - 3\"},{\"group\":\"group\",\"data\":[{\"x\":0.4226,\"y\":-2.6151,\"label\":\"Máximo (1 - √3/3, -3 + 2√3/9)\",\"color\":\"#E74C3C\"},{\"x\":1.5774,\"y\":-3.3849,\"label\":\"Mínimo (1 + √3/3, -3 - 2√3/9)\",\"color\":\"#27AE60\"}],\"type\":\"scatter\",\"name\":\"Puntos Críticos\",\"marker\":{\"radius\":6},\"tooltip\":{\"pointFormat\":\"<b>{point.label}<\\/b>\"}}],\"xAxis\":{\"type\":\"linear\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"x\"},\"crosshair\":true}},\"theme\":{\"chart\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"transparent\"},\"colors\":[\"#7cb5ec\",\"#434348\",\"#90ed7d\",\"#f7a35c\",\"#8085e9\",\"#f15c80\",\"#e4d354\",\"#2b908f\",\"#f45b5b\",\"#91e8e1\"]},\"conf_opts\":{\"global\":{\"Date\":null,\"VMLRadialGradientURL\":\"http =//code.highcharts.com/list(version)/gfx/vml-radial-gradient.png\",\"canvasToolsURL\":\"http =//code.highcharts.com/list(version)/modules/canvas-tools.js\",\"getTimezoneOffset\":null,\"timezoneOffset\":0,\"useUTC\":true},\"lang\":{\"contextButtonTitle\":\"Chart context menu\",\"decimalPoint\":\".\",\"downloadCSV\":\"Download CSV\",\"downloadJPEG\":\"Download JPEG image\",\"downloadPDF\":\"Download PDF document\",\"downloadPNG\":\"Download PNG image\",\"downloadSVG\":\"Download SVG vector image\",\"downloadXLS\":\"Download XLS\",\"drillUpText\":\"◁ Back to {series.name}\",\"exitFullscreen\":\"Exit from full screen\",\"exportData\":{\"annotationHeader\":\"Annotations\",\"categoryDatetimeHeader\":\"DateTime\",\"categoryHeader\":\"Category\"},\"hideData\":\"Hide data table\",\"invalidDate\":null,\"loading\":\"Loading...\",\"months\":[\"January\",\"February\",\"March\",\"April\",\"May\",\"June\",\"July\",\"August\",\"September\",\"October\",\"November\",\"December\"],\"noData\":\"No data to display\",\"numericSymbolMagnitude\":1000,\"numericSymbols\":[\"k\",\"M\",\"G\",\"T\",\"P\",\"E\"],\"printChart\":\"Print chart\",\"resetZoom\":\"Reset zoom\",\"resetZoomTitle\":\"Reset zoom level 1:1\",\"shortMonths\":[\"Jan\",\"Feb\",\"Mar\",\"Apr\",\"May\",\"Jun\",\"Jul\",\"Aug\",\"Sep\",\"Oct\",\"Nov\",\"Dec\"],\"shortWeekdays\":[\"Sat\",\"Sun\",\"Mon\",\"Tue\",\"Wed\",\"Thu\",\"Fri\"],\"thousandsSep\":\" \",\"viewData\":\"View data table\",\"viewFullscreen\":\"View in full screen\",\"weekdays\":[\"Sunday\",\"Monday\",\"Tuesday\",\"Wednesday\",\"Thursday\",\"Friday\",\"Saturday\"]}},\"type\":\"chart\",\"fonts\":[],\"debug\":false},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n### $g(x) = x^4 - 4x^2$\n\n**$g(x) = x^4 - 4x^2$**\n\n**1. Primera derivada**\n$$g'(x) = 4x^3 - 8x$$\n\n**2. Puntos críticos ($g'(x) = 0$)**\n\nPrimero factorizamos por factor común:\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n4x(x^2 - 2) &= 0 \n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nEsto nos da un punto crítico en $x = 0$. \n\nPara el paréntesis, resolvemos: \n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nx^2 - 2 &= 0 \\\\\nx^2 &= 2 \\\\\nx &= \\pm\\sqrt{2}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$. \n\nNuestros puntos críticos son:\n\n* $x = 0$\n* $x =+\\sqrt{2}$\n* $x=-\\sqrt{2}$.\n\n**3. Segunda derivada**\n$$g''(x) = 12x^2 - 8$$\n\n**4. Evaluar puntos críticos**\n\n* Para $x = 0$: $g''(0) = -8$. Es menor a cero, por lo tanto hay un **máximo**.\n* Para $x = \\sqrt{2}$: $g''(\\sqrt{2}) = 12(2) - 8 = 16$. Es mayor a cero, por lo tanto hay un **mínimo**.\n* Para $x = -\\sqrt{2}$: $g''(-\\sqrt{2}) = 12(2) - 8 = 16$. Es mayor a cero, por lo tanto hay un **mínimo**.\n\n**5. Coordenadas finales**\n\nEvaluamos en la función original $g(x)$:\n\n* $g(0) = 0 \\implies \\text{Punto máximo: } \\mathbf{(0, 0)}$\n* $g(\\sqrt{2}) = (\\sqrt{2})^4 - 4(\\sqrt{2})^2 = 4 - 8 = -4 \\implies \\text{Punto mínimo: } \\mathbf{(\\sqrt{2}, -4)}$\n* $g(-\\sqrt{2}) = (-\\sqrt{2})^4 - 4(-\\sqrt{2})^2 = 4 - 8 = -4 \\implies \\text{Punto mínimo: } \\mathbf{(-\\sqrt{2}, -4)}$\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {#fig-ejercicio2 .cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"highchart html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-4f268a5113689ad73b39\" style=\"width:100%;height:464px;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-4f268a5113689ad73b39\">{\"x\":{\"hc_opts\":{\"chart\":{\"reflow\":true},\"title\":{\"text\":null},\"yAxis\":{\"title\":{\"text\":\"g(x)\"},\"type\":\"linear\"},\"credits\":{\"enabled\":false},\"exporting\":{\"enabled\":false},\"boost\":{\"enabled\":false},\"plotOptions\":{\"series\":{\"label\":{\"enabled\":false},\"turboThreshold\":0,\"showInLegend\":false},\"treemap\":{\"layoutAlgorithm\":\"squarified\"},\"scatter\":{\"marker\":{\"symbol\":\"circle\"},\"dataLabels\":{\"enabled\":true,\"format\":\"{point.label}\",\"y\":-15}}},\"series\":[{\"group\":\"group\",\"data\":[{\"x\":-2.5,\"y\":14.06},{\"x\":-2.45,\"y\":12.02},{\"x\":-2.4,\"y\":10.14},{\"x\":-2.35,\"y\":8.41},{\"x\":-2.3,\"y\":6.82},{\"x\":-2.25,\"y\":5.38},{\"x\":-2.2,\"y\":4.07},{\"x\":-2.15,\"y\":2.88},{\"x\":-2.1,\"y\":1.81},{\"x\":-2.05,\"y\":0.85},{\"x\":-2,\"y\":0},{\"x\":-1.95,\"y\":-0.75},{\"x\":-1.9,\"y\":-1.41},{\"x\":-1.85,\"y\":-1.98},{\"x\":-1.8,\"y\":-2.46},{\"x\":-1.75,\"y\":-2.87},{\"x\":-1.7,\"y\":-3.21},{\"x\":-1.65,\"y\":-3.48},{\"x\":-1.6,\"y\":-3.69},{\"x\":-1.55,\"y\":-3.84},{\"x\":-1.5,\"y\":-3.94},{\"x\":-1.45,\"y\":-3.99},{\"x\":-1.4,\"y\":-4},{\"x\":-1.35,\"y\":-3.97},{\"x\":-1.3,\"y\":-3.9},{\"x\":-1.25,\"y\":-3.81},{\"x\":-1.2,\"y\":-3.69},{\"x\":-1.15,\"y\":-3.54},{\"x\":-1.1,\"y\":-3.38},{\"x\":-1.05,\"y\":-3.19},{\"x\":-1,\"y\":-3},{\"x\":-0.95,\"y\":-2.8},{\"x\":-0.9,\"y\":-2.58},{\"x\":-0.85,\"y\":-2.37},{\"x\":-0.8,\"y\":-2.15},{\"x\":-0.75,\"y\":-1.93},{\"x\":-0.7,\"y\":-1.72},{\"x\":-0.65,\"y\":-1.51},{\"x\":-0.6,\"y\":-1.31},{\"x\":-0.55,\"y\":-1.12},{\"x\":-0.5,\"y\":-0.9399999999999999},{\"x\":-0.45,\"y\":-0.77},{\"x\":-0.4,\"y\":-0.61},{\"x\":-0.35,\"y\":-0.47},{\"x\":-0.3,\"y\"